    "sections": {
        "description": "WENS FitZone is a modern Full Site Editing (FSE) WordPress theme designed specifically for gyms, fitness centers, personal trainers, and wellness studios. Built as a child theme of WENS Haelo, it features a bold dark design that creates a strong, energetic, and professional visual presence ideal for fitness and athletic brands. As a block-based theme, WENS FitZone allows complete customization through the WordPress Site Editor, giving users full control over layouts, typography, colors, and templates without needing to write code. It includes fitness-focused layouts and patterns suitable for showcasing training programs, class schedules, trainers, membership plans, testimonials, and services. The theme is fully responsive, performance-optimized, and compatible with popular plugins, making it a flexible and powerful solution for building a high-impact gym or fitness website."
    },
